songs.lyrics:
Verse 1
Lhandampu lenna Zion gam chu,
Kalung hel nia ka ngaito le;
Keijong len ding kanom,
Kalung donna hileiset hi;
Chomkah a hung mangloi ding ahiye,
Nao bangin nui tange.

Verse 2
Leiset gimna thoh a kalen hi,
Kapa nunnemin eive le;
Eilungset ngeiyinte,
Eilungset in kalha among;
Ajou le agam’a eipuiyinte,
Nao bangin nui tange.

Verse 3
Ka lhandampu nunnem kangaiye,
Amel mulouva ka um hi;
Kalha alengvaiye,
Leiset lungjin gal’in apang;
Kakom’a um jingle Pakai nunnem;
I-lou kalungdon dem?

Verse 4
Leisetna hin lengvaiyin kaleng,
Hijongle lungdong taponge;
Pakai lhamon ka-ngai,
Kalu hin nei hin lekhun lang;
Leisetna Ah bangin kivai jong leng,
Nathisan lu ka ngai.

Verse 1
Canaan phaicham Saron pahhoi,
Rome engseten anasubong’un;
Mol le lhang angui Saron apul jal’in,
Nunao agenthei abel ding umtalou;
Adamnau Saron pah apul jal’in.

Verse 2
Saron pahhoi apul nungin,
Ama lungtohte ho koma chun;
Lilyn ahungpah alungu thim sunga,
Alu chunguva jing Valpan ahung vah;
Avel’u kipa namtui ahung nung.

Verse 3
Saron pah nahoijou tapoi,
Sim le mal sah le lhang gam thim’a;
Meipi ajingin napah hoi le dingin,
Nisan hung vah-in Namel hung kilang hen;
Chuteng nahoiye chu hetauvinte.

Verse 4
Canaan phaicham Saron pah hoi,
Juda gam’a hung donthah kit in;
Mitin anom tai leichung thil jouse jong,
Nang ngaiyin mitlhi along leiset mihem;
Israelten jong vahchoi tan nate.

Verse 5
Aw Saron pah mu ka nom’e,
Van loupi a nahung vah ding chu;
Chamna thingphunga napulna mun’a chun,
Hung kivonin natin mihem loupinan;
Sa le mihem kidou kitta ponte.

Doh is G. (Luke 2:14)

Verse 1
Ngaiyin vantil ho la sah,
“Leng pengthah chu loupi hen;”
Leiya cham le ol leng hen,
Pathen le michonse ho ;
A kihou cham kittauve,
Vannoi namtin kipah un ;
Van lasa ho chu jom-mun;
Bethlehem kho sunga chun ;
Christa chu ahung peng tai,
Leng peng thah chu loupi hen.

Verse 2
Chungnungpen’in a vahchoi,
Christa tonsot Pakai chu ;
Ahung pen ding ki seisa,
Nu-ngah theng tah oi sunga ;
Tahsa phen ahungpeng tai,
Leiset mihem naosen’in ;
Leiset mi toh chengkhom din,
Jesu Immanuel chu ;
Mihemin ahung peng tai,
Leng peng thah chu loupi hen.

Verse 3
Chamna Leng chu vahchoiyun,
Vahchoiyun Ni sohthah chu ;
Hinna khovah ahin poi,
Alhaving jap dam theina ;
A loupina hin dalhan,
Mihemte sochatna din ;
Leiset mite tungdoh din,
Penthah kit thu ahin poi ;
Mihemin ahung penge,
Leng pengthah chu loupi hen.

Doh is A. dl (Luke 2:15)

Verse 1
Hungun Pathen mite,Kipa nop la sauvin ;
Bethlehem’a cheu hite, Hung loiyuvin ;
Hungun gaveute, Vantilte Lengpa so.
Hungun ! gahouvu hite,
Hungun ! gahouvu hite ;
Hungun ! gahouvu hite,
Leng Christa.

Verse 2
Sauvin van mi jousen, Kipah in la sauvin ;
Sauvin chungnung pen’a cheng, Vantil japin ;
Chung gam thenga chun, Pathen mitheng len hen.

Verse 3
Leiya cheng asemsa, Hing jousen la sauvin ;
Vahchoiyun mihem’a peng, Christa Pathen ;
Van le lei Pakai, Leng hat chungnung Jesu.

Verse 4
Nom hen Christa na min, Leiya nahung peng tai ;
Tonsot tonsot geiyin, Na min ja um hen !
Pathen Thu gou chu, Tahsa phen apeng tai.

Verse 1
Canan gamthah hinjon dingin,
Gamthip a jin kahi;
Ka vahlen ka lamvai tai tun,
Mei le meikong hungvah in;
Ka ang’a nang hungvah in lang.
Aw ka Lhandampu nei lamdot in,
Canaan gam chaan ding ka dip dap;
Lungdonna mei thim noiya,
Kap le lungdongin kamaove.

Verse 2
Dangchahna gam songpi chunga,
Hinna twi theng put hen;
Canaan gam jon lhasam don din,
Leisetna ka um lai hin;
Aigupta gam sumil dingin.

Verse 3
Kama a sangja alut tai,
Canaan gam nom’a chun;
Aigupta ngaikit taponge,
Thina gam ka dalhah teng;
Hinna khopi lam jon tange.

Verse 4
Van’a valpa vanlai jol’a,
Lhandampu avahchoi;
Leiya genthei sumil jouvin,
Kipa sa dingin;
Chu-a lhah ding chu ka nom’e.

Verse 1
Hinna thengpen sempu deilouvin Zion’a,
Minset le lungdon thoh-in amatsah tauve;
A-ankong umpi ho jong dougal soh jouta,
Asetnau dungjuiyin mipi simsen louten;
Juda lamkai sah-un Pakai mat ding deinan.

Verse 2
Tichun aman tauve thempu lal insunga,
Ling lukhuh khuhpeh dingin thu alhunsah un;
Ling lukhuh khuhpeh un Pakai lu thenga chun,
Khut’in abenguvin thisan long hol hol’in;
Lhandampu akaiyun Calvary lam jonin.

Verse 3
Thingpel hin lhutsah-un Calvary lhanga chun,
Thingkil alauvin Pakai khetbehna dingin;
Pakai akhai sangun amel ngui hiuheuvin,
Anah teng’a sunun thisan le twi longlhan;
Zion kulpi sunga thu atankhel jeh-un.

Verse 4
Themgao ho seibangin Lhandampu athoh-e,
Pa thutep dungjuiyin Lhandampun amolsoi;
Van mithengte ho chun vanpi kinim bangin,
Lhagao ahung thouve lhanthim’a jalsa ho;
Pakai hung lamtouvin khotheng nom’a leng din.

Verse 5
Na thohna mil louvin setna thim ajinge,
Namai ahin tom’un navah hoi le dingin;
Khohthah-in kile hen namel emsilsel hen,
Namel’a lungset kai hen kalhi jong long hen;
Kalung gil sunga hin Pakai nang hung lengin.

Verse 1
Pathen lungset khoto nan,
Vannoi thil aum’e;
Hiche bang chun nu le pa ana umsah-e,
Kidei ding le kingai din;
Pathenin asem’e,
Tona pi le pu jong chu;
Pathen janggop anahi.
Pathen ngailutna,
Pathen nang ngailutna;
Hiche teni chunga hin,
Pathen nang ngailut um hen.

Verse 2
Ka golnu le ka golpau,
Gollhang, nungah, chapang;
Anu apa api apu nupi upa,
Lunglhaiyunte abon’un;
Pathen jong chutinte,
Nagol napai keiho jong;
Kalungu alhai cheh-e.

Verse 3
Pathen lungset ngailutnan,
Gol le pai nangnin vang;
Nungah khang le gollhang khang,
Na dalha lhon tai;
Nagol napai keiho jong,
Nei hin sumil lhon hih-un.

Verse 4
Pathen lungset khoto nan,
Nagol napai kei hon;
Apa, Acha, Lhagao Theng,
Min ka vahchoiyun;
Nangni lemna le ja-nan,
Mol hoi pah eng vuiyin;
Nagoldei napai deiten,
Sana khangin kalem’ui.

Doh is E. Flat d. (Psalms 25:1)

Verse 1
Ka tahsanin navei,
Calvary Kelngoinou ;
Pathen Jesu,
Ka taona ngaijin lang ;
Ka mona ngaidamin,
Tunia pat tukal’in ,
Nei thensah-in.

Verse 2
Na mi lungset hao chun,
Kalung bei hatsah hen ;
Lungtheng neipen,
Keima jal’a nathi ;
Nang ka ngaicheh nadin,
Kikhellou lung thengsel ;
Meiyin kong hen.

Verse 3
Muthim’a kalhah a,
Ka lungjin lungdon teng ;
Lam nei hil’in,
Tunin muthim pailhan ;
Ka lhi thehhul soh-in,
Nei lhadoh kit datan ;
Nang koma kon.

Verse 4
Ka hinkho bulhin’a,
Thina twidap jen chun ;
Eilon khum teng,
Nei lungset in neilan ;
Kichat sumang soh-in.
Bit keichan van chunga ;
Neipui touvin.

Verse 1
Lem’un Lhandampu Naosen’in,
Tunin vannoiya hin ahung penge;
Christiante kipah hen khong le dah thouhen,
Lem’u hen a-Lhandampu vahchoiyu hen.

Verse 2
Nom hen Christiante nom hen hin,
Na le damna thu eihin pohpeh-ui;
Chungnung pen’a Pathen loupina hihen,
Noi leisetna chamna le lung ol leng hen.

Verse 3
Lhandampu penni hin kipa,
Nop la sauvin chung le noiya miten;
Chung le noi kidongtota Pakai pennin,
Hichu vannoi chonset’a kon penthah ni.

Verse 4
Tuni noppi ni ahi Van,
Kotpi kihongta chitin namtin din;
Nalhagao le nalungin kipah-uvin,
Kipah nomloute chu Damun’a che ding.
Leiset hinlai dam sungin jong,
Pathen vang pehna chu;
Chang talou ding.
