Doh is A. Flat m. (Psalms 146:2)

Verse 1
Vahchoi cheh un Eihuhhingpau nunnom Jesu,
Eilungsetnau kidang chu lan sauvin ;
A vahchoiyui chunga cheng Vantil jousen jong,
Loupi jana Ama jenga hihen ;

Chorus
Kelngoi chin bang Jesun achate aching,
A khut’in nitinin akaihoi lei ;
A vahchoiyui chunga cheng vantil jousen jong,
Loupi jana Ama jenga hihen.

Verse 2
Vahchoi cheh un Eihuhhingpau nunnom Jesu,
Chonse lhatnan Cross chunga ahung thi ;
I sochatnau tonsot kulpi Ama ahi,
Vahchoi cheh un Cross chunga thi Jesu ;
Vahchoi cheh un chonset pomang Jesu chu,
Eilungsetnau iti kidan hitam ;
I sochatnau tonsot kulpi Ama ahi,
Vahchoi cheh un Cross chunga thi Jesu.

Verse 3
Vahchoi cheh un Eihuhhingpau nunnom Jesu,
Vantil sangjan Hosana asam’ui ;
Huhhing Jesu tonsot tonsot in Leng chang hen,
Lemun, lemun, Themgao, Thempu Leng chu ;
A loupina Christa hungkit ding leiya,
Thahat, loupi Pakaiya hijing ding ;
Huhhing Jesu tonsot tonsot in Leng chang hen,
Lemun, lemun, Themgao, Thempu Leng chu.

Doh is C. (Rev. 5:11)

Verse 1
Mitheng sangsom jat sangsom,
Huhhingsa galmi hon ;
Pon bang jeng akisil cheh un ,
Khovah mun ajonun ;
Thina, chonset achaiyun,
A galsat ajou vun ;
Sana kotpi a alut tauve,
Jo la asa lut’un.
Halleluiyah ! Halleluiyah,
Akithatsa Kelngoinou ;
Halleluiyah ! Halleluiyah,
Ahingdoh kit’a chu.

Verse 2
Halleluiyah asamun,
Van le leiya dipmun ;
Selangdah sangsom gin ngeiyin,
Jo la ngei asauvin ;
Leiset thilsem jouse le,
Chitin namtin semnia ;
Pat’a hesohna jouse chu,
Akisa chai soh tai.

Verse 3
Canaan gam nom hoitah chu,
Mithengte len bolna ;
Anopsah jeu seithei louvin,
Kikhen kit umlou ding ;
Mi mai vahsel sohta ding,
Mitlhi so um talou ;
Genthei lengvai nulou palou,
Meithai pagong umlou.

Verse 1
Kangah jinge ka Pakai,
Lei genthei thim jing noiya;
Nei holnau Salem khopi,
Aw keiman kangai tai;
Leiset gentheina le,
Thim noiya hin leng jong leng;
Lungsetna eihol Pa chu,
Ken kangai bang lou ding.
Van loupi Eden thah nom chu,
Lungdon umlouna gam nom chu;
Aw itih le hung lhung tang’em?
Na tonsot lalna gam emnom hoitah chu.

Verse 2
Hung ngaiyin ei Lhandampu,
Leisetna gal ahat’e;
Thisanna nalhatsate,
Lung dongin akap-e;
Leiya nalen laiya,
Nalung donna Calvary;
Melmate ahung naiye,
Nagam doudalte chu.

Verse 3
Aw hoikom ham Lhandampu,
Zion lhang gal amonna;
Set sop thenga milungset,
Ka diuva Nalouna;
Chonset thenna kulpi,
Na tonsot vangkho le veng;
Lhatdam cha nalim noiya,
Nom’a alennau chu.

Verse 4
Aw leiset hi hung mang ding,
Loupina jouse jong hi;
Lhandampun mi hinkhom ding,
Ken leiset pelta ding;
Christa lungsette chu,
Lal loupina changunte;
Lungsetna akinonge
Nom’un Hallelujah.

Verse 1
Kalhagao gakhol’in Jerusalem daiya,
Calvary mol le lhang ho;
Thing le thisan chu gaven,
Chu-a gacheng jingin, mikicha jeng jongle;
Pakai long lahlhah phat tengle,
Lhan hom geiyin gaven.
Ana ngeiye kati, kalungset Lhandampu,
Thisan louva Lhatdam thei hile chun;
Aw ka Pakai, Van kho nguiya,
Saron pahhoi chullou ding;
Hinla Jesu, Nadin vanpi achim.

Verse 2
Aw ka Pakai deitah, Nalaltouna kaven,
Kadai thoh a chun lhan goh a;
Van Lal Cha najal chu,
Ana ngeiye kati, ana ngeiye kati;
Itileng ken ilo tangem?
Lhan songin khah jouta.

Verse 3
Ka vavei ding hitam, Pakai hoilam nahim?
Calvary lhang chunga nathia;
Namel kamu lai chun,
Tun kalung adongin kalha alengvaiye;
Ka Pakai lungdon mel kamu,
Kalungin mil joulou.

Verse 4
Ka man thisan ahin Van’a lal kahitai,
Leiset gou thil’a lhat hilou;
Thisanna lhat kahi,
Ka Pa inlam kahei lungdon meipi gal’a;
Chu-a aman eipui lut ding,
Zion lhang ka gam’a.

Doh is C. sl (Luke 24:6)

Verse 1
Lhan thima lum ahi, Lhandampu Jesu ;
Ni hunglhung ding ngah in Pakai Jesu.
Lhan’a konin athou tai,
A thahat’in agalte jouvin ;
Thina muthim gam jouvin ahung thoutai,
Tonsot loupi laltouna a tou dingin ;
Athoutai, athou tai, Halleluiyah athou tai.

Verse 2
Alhan ngau moh ahi, Lhandampu Jesu ;
Khuhsin song moh ahin, Pakai Jesu.

Verse 3
Thinan ahenjou poi, Lhandampu Jesu ;
Lhan sin song phujalta Pakai Jesu.

Verse 1
Ka monmo kalunghel ni hin,
Tong donna abanna ahi;
Ka leiset lonlhi long pum’in,
Naban jet ka hin sang’e tun;
Kisan’in chibai gollhangpa. (2)

Verse 2
Goldei nungteng huiva mao ding,
Khoto nan navang ka kapme;
Banjal’in lonlhi huiyin lang,
Tongdonin thimthu lel tem’o;
Laigil’a geltwi bang dap ding. (2)

Verse 3
Nalong damsa tongdon theilou,
Keiman lhisopi jeng jong leng;
Ichung thangvan sang najon tai,
Pakai Jesu Christa’n lhonpin;
Ka lhauve goldei ngai chimlou.

Verse 4
Hinoi leiset gim munna hin,
Golte ngaiyin mongjou ponge;
Van chung gam nom nalhun tengle,
Che masa chin ngaite heng’a;
Khankho thimthu cheng naleltan.

Doh is G. m. (Exo. 13:22)

Verse 1
Lungset tah-in vangam khopi jotna, Lam nei hil’in ;
Jan muthim’a lamdih a nei puiyin, Nei lamkaiyin ;
A gamlai tin ka lungkham deh sampoi,
Kal khat khat’in nanung nung jui nange.

Verse 2
Eipui dih jing thei Nang kana jui dan, Ka nom chon len ;
Kei chonna jeng bou aphan ka ngaiton, Ka chonkhel tai ;
Ka kichatna a jong kana hoithon,
Lungset themin hichu nei ngaidamin.

Verse 3
Na banin neikol jing jengin tukal, Nei kai jingin ;
Muthim’a jong bitkeiyin nei puiyin, Nei lamkaiyin ;
Tona thisa ka sopi ngai jouse,
Mu kit tange jing niso teng chuleh.

Doh is C. d. (Tit. 2:13)

Verse 1
Nang nahung ding O Lhandampu,
Nang nahung ding vo Lengpa ;
Pao tinin Nangma vahchoi ding,
Vahchoi O tang talou ding ;
Nang nahung ding na thi jal’a,
Ponjal laiya lhanga chun ;
Cholte kipa sah sohta ding,
Nopni loupi ni hiding.
Nang nahung ding (2 vei)
Lam kim’a ikimu diu ;
Nang nahung teng, Nang kamu diu,
Leiya nalen lai mel’a;
Nang nahung ding, (2 vei)
Pakai, Nang ka ngai chungnung ;
Na vaihom nikho ka ngah lel,
Tonsot’a ka vahchoi ding.

Verse 2
Nang nahung ding hesoh genthei,
Ka le lhiso beita ding ;
Chonsetna kisei kit lou ding,
Jing noso emsel jing le;
Nang nahung ding Huhhing Jesu,
Dei le ngai dang umlou ding ;
Chu gam hoi le loupina chu,
Thisan’a nalhat ahi.

Verse 3
Nang nahung ding ka ngah jingui,
Thonlou kinepna ging chan ;
Phat le nikho ngah lel louvin,
Ngah jingin, Nang ka sangui ;
Nang nahung ding Antheng jonga,
Nahung kit ding ka heuve ;
Tua Antheng ijonkhom bangun,
Van’a jong ijonkhom diu.

Doh is G. m. (Deut. 33:27)

Verse 1
Um kahi Jesu khut’a,
A angsung lim dam’a ;
Eilungset kemlou lim’a,
Ka lhan nomsa jing ding ;
Ngai temuvin Vantilten,
Ka din la asauve ;
Van chung gamtheng em nom’a,
Van gam khovah noma.
Um kahi Jesu khut’a,
A ang sung lim dam’a ;
Ei lungset kemlou lim’a,
Ka lhan nomsa jing ding.

Verse 2
Um kahi Jesu khut’a,
Lungdonna um talou ;
Leiset lung ngai beita ding,
Chonset leng talou ding ;
Ka ongtai gimna a kon,
Kichat tijat umlou ;
Chomkhat lungdon le genthei,
Ka le lhiso na dim.

Verse 3
Jesu keima lung kaina,
Keima huhnan athi ;
Songpi bang hen ka tahsan,
Det jing hen Christa a ;
Nei umpin, nei ngah jingin,
Jan muthim bei kahsen;
Jing khovah hoi kamu man,
Vah jing van gam nom’a.

Doh is F. (Psalms 17:8)

Verse 1
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Cholngah nom aum;
Tong gimte le pohgihte din,
Heng le koma jol le gol din;
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Cholngah nom aum;
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Ol aum.
Ol aum, mon aum, nop aum,
Jesu lhalim noiya chun.

Verse 2
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Cham le lungmon a um ;
Cham le thilpha hettoh theina,
Nop le lung ol kem talou ding ;
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Cham le lungmon um ;
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Cham aum.

Verse 3
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Kipa thanop um ;
Kipa thusim seiding aum,
Kipa thanop chungnung ahi ;
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Kipa thanop um ;
Jesu lhalim noiya chun,
Nop aum.

Doh is A. Flat d. (Psalms 144:2)

Verse 1
Cholna janthim lungdonna hin,
Meipi jing bangin eitom;
Kho hungvah ding kon ahitai,
Van’a ni hungsoh ding chu ;
Zion molsang vum’a kona,
Eikounau O jau hitin ;
Kipah tah-a kikhom soh ding,
Leng ahung teng le.
Gentheite kipah un,
Na loupina diu ni chu ahung naitai ;
Gentheite kipah un, Leng chungnung,
I ngau chu hung ding ahitai.

Verse 2
Jesu thisan’a lhatsate,
So le lhum lam’a konin ;
Kipah in hung kikhomun tin,
Olna gam tep noma chun ;
Vannoi chitin le namtin mi,
Gam tina kon hung ho chu ;
Kipah tah a kikhom soh ding,
Leng ahung teng le.

Verse 3
Asun ajan’a ngah ho chu,
Tahsan’a athua nunga ;
Tang louva ana tong jing ho,
Lhagao chemjam pante chu ;
Vannoi leiset thim lah a hi,
A thaomei vah jing ho chu ;
Kipah nunnoma khomsoh ding,
Leng ahung teng le.

Verse 1
Ka ngai ngeiye i-tonsot gam,
Le song mantam khopi le achungvum chu;
Nisa sangin avahjoi tiuvin,
Mu kanom ngei Pakai inpi,
Van mite lenna.

Verse 2
Van innom jotna jalampi,
Asih-a pel’a lamvai ding kadip dap;
Kei ka chonset le hatlou jeh hin,
Van Canaan gam hoi le loupi;
Cha’n ding kadip dap.

Verse 3
Pakai na-Lhagao pui lou chun,
Koima hung lhung theilou ding leiset gam mi;
Lhagao manthahna gam anahin,
Tahsan ho chunga aw Pakai;
Setnan lha ajal.

Verse 4
Ajou ho chun Apao gam’a,
Nisa sanga vahjon ana um’untin;
Leiset lunggimna le hesohna,
Akipa nauvin pah-in tin;
Chultih neilou ding.

Verse 5
Len kanom ngei Van inpi-a,
I-tonsot cholngahna ding anom ngeiye;
Pakaiyin asem Salem khopi,
Leng cheh leu hen eiho jouse;
Lunggim umlou ding.

Verse 1
Vasoh banga len them hileng kei,
Ka Pakai thina lhang gavenge;
Hia chun eilhatna ga munge,
Achunga thisan kainel nul chu;
Lungset pon nem’in gatheh inge.
Aw Calvary, aw calvary,
Nachunga na Lal akhen beh-un;
Thouvin lang akilna botdoh-in,
Athisan lu chu gatheh ngim’in.

Verse 2
Kidron vadung nang jong thouvin lang,
Ka Pakai dangchah chu donsah din;
Juthuh-in adangchah pha ponte,
Chen lang amintheng tah noiya chun;
Nem hiuheu chan galon peh-in lang.

Verse 3
Kei ngaiya dangchah hile vang chu,
Kidron ti-in eihin kou tante;
Malai chun gadon sah tang kate,
Nang ngaiya adangchah ahiye;
Chen kalha twi chu gadon sah-in.

Verse 4
Gache jong leng igalong katem?
I-Pakai dangchah phatsahna din;
Hetna imacha la kanei pon,
Che vang cheng kate Calvary a;
Athisan long beh gatheh inge.

Verse 5
Calvary le aw Jerusalem,
Pakai chonnem hi eika-huvin;
Ichonset jal’a genthei ahi,
Thouvin lang akilna botdoh-in;
Van Kelngoinou chu athi ni hin.

Verse 1
Gam nilhum louna van gam’a,
Van mithengten vai ahom’un;
